{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[GAME INTRODUCTION]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve the riddles and escape from the room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game comes with auto-save, so you can play from the beginning of the game at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have trouble solving the riddle, you can see the hints and solutions in the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[How to play]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on the place you are interested in to investigate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select an item by clicking on it, and click on the location where you want to use it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on the item to enlarge it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some items will combine with each other if you use another item on the enlarged item. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tiny Room Collection</strong> is a game in which you use the mouse to click on various places in the room, solve puzzles, and escape from the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 21 tiny rooms in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you escape from all the rooms? </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3533720?t=1743127428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533720/f869cc6b7fc373804f9790536b71312e4702ddb6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743127428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533720/216b8f7da26707999c77cba03196ed5e5f24d5e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743127428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533720/216b8f7da26707999c77cba03196ed5e5f24d5e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743127428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[GAME INTRODUCTION]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve the riddles and escape from the room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game comes with auto-save, so you can play from the beginning of the game at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have trouble solving the riddle, you can see the hints and solutions in the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[How to play]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on the place you are interested in to investigate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select an item by clicking on it, and click on the location where you want to use it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on the item to enlarge it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some items will combine with each other if you use another item on the enlarged item. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tiny Room Collection</strong> is a game in which you use the mouse to click on various places in the room, solve puzzles, and escape from the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 21 tiny rooms in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you escape from all the rooms? </p>","developers":["Studio Wakaba"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533720/34b6d0d6ce717e243bbe6fffcb877dcc0670d797/header.jpg?t=1743127428","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Escape Room: Tiny Room Collection","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</stro